      "apiDescription": "## Models\n\nTwo-way bindings. Bind each one with the `v-model` syntax shown next to it — do not pass the prop and listen to its `update:` event separately.\n\n```\nexport type GDrawerModels = {\n  modelValue?: boolean; // v-model=\"...\"\n}\n```\n\n## Props\n\n```\nexport type GDrawerProps = {\n  /** @default 'rtl' */\n  direction?: string;\n  /** @default '400px' */\n  size?: string | number;\n  /** @default '' */\n  description?: string;\n  /** @default true */\n  modalFade?: boolean;\n  /** @default '2' */\n  headerAriaLevel?: string;\n  /** @default true */\n  withHeader?: boolean;\n  /** @default true */\n  showClose?: boolean;\n  /** @default false */\n  responsiveSize?: boolean | ResponsiveSizeDrawer;\n  appendToBody?: boolean;\n  appendTo?: string | HTMLElement;\n  destroyOnClose?: boolean;\n  closeOnClickModal?: boolean;\n  closeOnPressEscape?: boolean;\n  lockScroll?: boolean;\n  modal?: boolean;\n  openDelay?: number;\n  closeDelay?: number;\n  trapFocus?: boolean;\n  ariaLevel?: string;\n  fullscreen?: boolean;\n  draggable?: boolean;\n  overflow?: boolean;\n  alignCenter?: boolean;\n  sizeMode?: string;\n  title?: string;\n  footerButtons?: FooterButton[];\n  beforeClose?: DialogBeforeCloseFn;\n  top?: string;\n  modalClass?: string;\n  headerClass?: string;\n  bodyClass?: string;\n  footerClass?: string;\n  width?: string | number;\n  zIndex?: number;\n}\n```\n\n## Events\n\n```\nexport type GDrawerEvents = {\n  open: [];\n  opened: [];\n  close: [];\n  closed: [];\n  \"update:modelValue\": [value: boolean];\n  openAutoFocus: [];\n  closeAutoFocus: [];\n}\n```\n\n## Slots\n\nEach slot is typed with the props it passes to its content.\n\n```\nexport type GDrawerSlots = {\n  customHeader: {};\n  default: {};\n  footer: {};\n}\n```\n\n## Exposed\n\nAvailable on the component instance through a template ref.\n\n```\nexport type GDrawerExposed = {\n  handleClose: () => void;\n  afterEnter: () => void;\n  afterLeave: () => void;\n}\n```",
      "renderer": "vue3"
    }
